{"seconds": 39.8, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! **Nxf3+** wins immediately:\n- **1...Nxf3+** (check, winning the knight)\n- **2.Kh1 hxg2#** (checkmate)\n\nThis is a devastating fork-and-mate pattern. The knight on d4 moves to f3 with check, forking the king and removing the defender of h2. After the forced Kh1, Black's pawn on h3 delivers checkmate on g2.\n\n**Coaching note:** When your knight is attacked, look for forcing checks\u2014especially forks. A knight check that also attacks another piece often leads to tactics. Here, Nxf3+ removes White's key defender of the kingside, leaving g2 fatally weak.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxf3+\", \"line\": [\"Nxf3+\", \"Kh1\", \"hxg2#\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\", \"attraction\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20", "move": "Ne2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P3N2/3BPN1p/1P2nPP1/R4RK1 w - - 1 21", "move": "Nxe2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P3N2/3BPN1p/1P2nPP1/R4RK1 w - - 1 21", "move": "Bxe2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P6/3BPN1p/1P2NPP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 21", "move": "Rxg2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P6/3BPN1p/1P2NPr1/R4RK1 w - - 0 22", "move": "Kh1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P6/3BPN1p/1P2NPr1/R4R1K b - - 1 22", "move": "Rg1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen"